recommend keep-going -- the census stands and the lane's own second door is the next mechanical lap. Worth Keaton's word on %499, sharper now that it has parked this seat twice in one day: may a round open rebase onto its own uncommitted work rather than stashing it, when the stash is the lap's own and no peer has touched the paths?
